    "Location rules wake the agent when you arrive or leave (may take a few minutes — iOS decides). Event and charging rules fire when the app reconciles. A rule auto-pauses once its 👎 outnumber its 👍 by three. Time-of-day rules live in Scheduled Tasks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location rules wake the agent when you arrive or leave (may take a few minutes — iOS decides). Event and charging rules fire when the app reconciles. A rule auto-pauses once its 👎 outnumber its 👍 by three. Time-of-day rules live in Scheduled Tasks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地点规则会在你到达或离开时唤醒 Agent（可能延迟几分钟，由 iOS 决定）。日程规则在 App 对账时触发,夜间充电规则交给下面的「安静任务」在夜里充电时执行。一条规则的 👎 比 👍 多三次会自动暂停。按时间触发的规则在「定时任务」里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地點規則會在你抵達或離開時喚醒 Agent（可能延遲幾分鐘，由 iOS 決定）。行程和充電規則在 App 對帳時觸發。一條規則的 👎 比 👍 多三次會自動暫停。按時間觸發的規則在「排程任務」裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not signed in to ChatGPT. Sign in again in Settings → Providers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
