    "Background Ready enables Enhanced Background Execution, Live Activity, and task notifications when a task is sent. Actual background lifetime remains controlled by iOS and the Keep-Alive status below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "后台就绪可在发送任务时启用增强后台执行、实时活动和任务通知。实际后台生命周期仍然由 iOS 和下面的 Keep-Alive 状态控制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "後台就緒可在發送任務時啟用增強後台執行、即時活動和任務通知。實際後台生命週期仍然由 iOS 和下面的 Keep-Alive 狀態控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
