    "Every zone LeoBot has created in your iCloud private database. **V2** holds the current sync engine's data; **V1** holds legacy per-device backups from older builds. Deleting a zone is permanent and removes everything inside (records + assets). Use this to reclaim space after migration completes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every zone LeoBot has created in your iCloud private database. **V2** holds the current sync engine's data; **V1** holds legacy per-device backups from older builds. Deleting a zone is permanent and removes everything inside (records + assets). Use this to reclaim space after migration completes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot 在你的 iCloud 私有数据库中创建的所有区域。**V2** 保存当前同步引擎的数据；**V1** 保存旧版本按设备的遗留备份。删除区域是永久操作，会移除其中的所有内容（记录 + 资源）。可在迁移完成后用它来释放空间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot 在你的 iCloud 私人資料庫中建立的所有區域。**V2** 保存目前同步引擎的資料；**V1** 保存舊版本按裝置的舊備份。刪除區域是永久操作，會移除其中的所有內容（記錄 + 資源）。可在遷移完成後用它來釋放空間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
