    "Verbose adds high-frequency traces (filesystem, rendering, context). Useful when reproducing a specific problem — logs grow very quickly, so switch back to Info afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbose adds high-frequency traces (filesystem, rendering, context). Useful when reproducing a specific problem — logs grow very quickly, so switch back to Info afterwards."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“详细”会额外记录高频追踪（文件系统、渲染、上下文），适合复现具体问题时使用。日志增长很快，复现完请切回“信息”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「詳細」會額外記錄高頻追蹤（檔案系統、渲染、上下文），適合重現特定問題時使用。日誌成長很快，重現完請切回「資訊」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
