    "LeoBot can store your transcript fixes (original → corrected pairs) and accepted AI corrections in a local on-device database to make future voice corrections smarter. Nothing is uploaded. You can change this or clear the data anytime in Settings → Permissions.": {
      "comment": "One-time prompt body: correction data collection",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot can store your transcript fixes (original → corrected pairs) and accepted AI corrections in a local on-device database to make future voice corrections smarter. Nothing is uploaded. You can change this or clear the data anytime in Settings → Permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot 可以将你对语音转录的修改(原文 → 修正对)以及被采纳的 AI 纠错保存到设备本地数据库,用于让后续语音纠错更聪明。数据不会上传。你可以随时在 设置 → 权限 中更改或清除这些数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot 可以將你對語音轉錄的修改(原文 → 修正對)以及被採納的 AI 糾錯儲存到裝置本機資料庫,用於讓後續語音糾錯更聰明。資料不會上傳。你可以隨時在 設定 → 權限 中更改或清除這些資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
