    "LeoBot does not operate an application server. Your data stays on your device unless you enable iCloud Sync, choose an AI provider, or invoke a device capability that communicates with another service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot 不运行应用程序服务器。除非您启用 iCloud 同步、选择 AI 提供商或调用与其他服务通信的设备功能，否则您的数据将保留在您的设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LeoBot 不運行應用程式伺服器。除非您啟用 iCloud 同步、選擇 AI 提供者或呼叫與其他服務通訊的裝置功能，否則您的資料將保留在您的裝置上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LeoBot does not operate any server and does not collect, store, or process any of your personal data. All data stays on your device.": {
