    "This action cannot be undone. All LeoBot data stored in iCloud will be erased immediately. Other devices signed into the same iCloud account will lose their synced copies on the next sync.\n\nLocal data on this device is safe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This action cannot be undone. All LeoBot data stored in iCloud will be erased immediately. Other devices signed into the same iCloud account will lose their synced copies on the next sync.\n\nLocal data on this device is safe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。iCloud 中存储的所有 LeoBot 数据将立即被删除。登录同一 iCloud 账户的其他设备将在下次同步时失去已同步的副本。\n\n本设备上的本地数据是安全的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作無法撤銷。iCloud 中存儲的所有 LeoBot 數據將立即被刪除。登錄同一 iCloud 賬戶的其他設備將在下次同步時失去已同步的副本。\n\n本設備上的本地數據是安全的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
