          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将删除整个 rootfs。所有数据将丢失。应用需要重新启动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將刪除整個 rootfs。所有數據將丟失。應用需要重新啓動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will delete the group. Model entries and provider instances are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete the group. Model entries and provider instances are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将删除该分组。模型条目和服务商实例不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將刪除該分組。模型條目和服務商實例不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will permanently delete everything LeoBot has uploaded to your iCloud account, across ALL of your devices:\n\n• Chat sessions & messages\n• Session files & attachments\n• Skills\n• Provider configurations\n• Environment variables\n\nThis device's local data will NOT be deleted — only the cloud copy. After the wipe, this device will re-upload its local content to a fresh iCloud zone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will permanently delete everything LeoBot has uploaded to your iCloud account, across ALL of your devices:\n\n• Chat sessions & messages\n• Session files & attachments\n• Skills\n• Provider configurations\n• Environment variables\n\nThis device's local data will NOT be deleted — only the cloud copy. After the wipe, this device will re-upload its local content to a fresh iCloud zone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作将永久删除 LeoBot 上传到您 iCloud 账户中的所有内容，跨您所有的设备：\n\n• 聊天会话和消息\n• 会话文件和附件\n• 技能\n• 服务商配置\n• 环境变量\n\n本设备上的本地数据不会被删除 —— 仅删除云端副本。删除后，本设备将把其本地内容重新上传到新的 iCloud 区域。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作將永久刪除 LeoBot 上傳到您 iCloud 賬戶中的所有內容，跨您所有的設備：\n\n• 聊天會話和消息\n• 會話文件和附件\n• 技能\n• 服務商配置\n• 環境變量\n\n本設備上的本地數據不會被刪除 —— 僅刪除雲端副本。刪除後，本設備將把其本地內容重新上傳到新的 iCloud 區域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will re-download all sync data from iCloud, which may take 10–30 seconds and consume significant network traffic. Wi-Fi is recommended.\n\nYour local sessions, skills, and files are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will re-download all sync data from iCloud, which may take 10–30 seconds and consume significant network traffic. Wi-Fi is recommended.\n\nYour local sessions, skills, and files are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将重新从 iCloud 下载所有同步数据，可能需要 10–30 秒并消耗较多网络流量。建议使用 Wi-Fi。\n\n您的本地会话、技能和文件不会受到影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將重新從 iCloud 下載所有同步資料，可能需要 10–30 秒並消耗較多網路流量。建議使用 Wi-Fi。\n\n您的本機工作階段、技能和檔案不會受到影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will remove all browsing history from the past 7 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will remove all browsing history from the past 7 days."
