    "No scheduled tasks yet. Tap + to add one — for example, run “Morning Briefing” at 8 AM every day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有计划任务。点右上角 + 新建一个，例如每天早上 8 点跑「早间简报」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有計劃任務。點右上角 + 新建一個，例如每天早上 8 點跑「早間簡報」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS does not let an app wake itself on a clock, so due tasks run at one of two moments: automatically when you open the app, or on time via a Shortcuts personal automation you set up. Tasks more than 26 hours overdue are skipped rather than all firing at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 不允许应用自行按时唤醒，所以到期任务会在下面两种时机执行：你打开应用时自动补跑，或由你设置的「快捷指令」个人自动化准时触发。超过 26 小时的过期任务会跳过，不会一次性补跑一堆。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 不允許應用自行按時喚醒，所以到期任務會在下面兩種時機執行：你開啟應用時自動補跑，或由你設定的「快捷指令」個人自動化準時觸發。超過 26 小時的過期任務會跳過，不會一次性補跑一堆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check and run due tasks now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即检查并运行到期任务"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即檢查並執行到期任務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No tasks are due right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在没有到期的任务"
