    "With this set up, Shortcuts wakes the app at the chosen time even if it is closed. Without it things still work — due tasks just wait until you next open the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这样即使应用没打开，快捷指令也会在设定时刻叫醒它执行到期任务。不设置也能用，只是会等到你下次打开应用时才补跑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
