    "Gemini's OAuth (Cloud Code Assist) support is complete, but the Google client secret was removed when this project was open-sourced. Create your own OAuth client in Google Cloud Console — an \"iOS\" type client needs no secret and is recommended.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gemini's OAuth (Cloud Code Assist) support is complete, but the Google client secret was removed when this project was open-sourced. Create your own OAuth client in Google Cloud Console — an \"iOS\" type client needs no secret and is recommended."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gemini 的 OAuth(Cloud Code Assist)已经完整支持,但项目开源时移除了内置的 Google 客户端密钥。请在 Google Cloud Console 里建一个自己的 OAuth 客户端 —— 推荐「iOS」类型,不需要密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gemini 的 OAuth(Cloud Code Assist)已經完整支援,但專案開源時移除了內建的 Google 用戶端密鑰。請在 Google Cloud Console 建立自己的 OAuth 用戶端 —— 建議選「iOS」類型,不需要密鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
