    "This app's bundled Google client secret was removed when it was open-sourced, so Gemini's \"Sign in with Google\" cannot finish authorization. Once you add your own client, the option appears among the authentication methods.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个应用内置的 Google 客户端密钥在开源时被移除了，所以 Gemini 的「用 Google 账号登录」无法完成授权。填入你自己的客户端后，登录选项会出现在认证方式里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個應用內建的 Google 客戶端金鑰在開源時被移除了，所以 Gemini 的「用 Google 賬號登入」無法完成授權。填入你自己的客戶端後，登入選項會出現在認證方式裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in this device's Keychain — never synced, never uploaded. Gemini and Antigravity share this client. Leaving the secret empty means an iOS-type client.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存在本机钥匙串，不会同步、不会上传。Gemini 与 Antigravity 共用这一套客户端。留空密钥即按 iOS 客户端处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存在本機鑰匙串，不會同步、不會上傳。Gemini 與 Antigravity 共用這一套客戶端。留空金鑰即按 iOS 客戶端處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
