          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「API 和服務 → 憑據 → 建立憑據 → OAuth 客戶端 ID」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose application type \"iOS\" and enter bundle ID com.leoyuan.leophoneagent": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用类型选「iOS」，Bundle ID 填 com.leoyuan.leophoneagent"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用型別選「iOS」，Bundle ID 填 com.leoyuan.leophoneagent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the client ID above and leave the secret empty": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把客户端 ID 填到上面，密钥留空即可"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把客戶端 ID 填到上面，金鑰留空即可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS is the correct client type for this app: Google issues no secret and instead proves identity with PKCE plus a reversed-client-ID callback, so there is nothing to bake into the binary.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 类型是这个 App 的正确客户端类型：Google 不发放密钥，改用 PKCE + 反向客户端 ID 回调来证明身份，也就不存在「把密钥打进二进制」的问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 型別是這個 App 的正確客戶端型別：Google 不發放金鑰，改用 PKCE + 反向客戶端 ID 回撥來證明身份，也就不存在「把金鑰打進二進位制」的問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you already have a \"Desktop app\" client (for example one created by following Google's Gemini API OAuth guide), fill in both the ID and the secret and the loopback callback flow is used automatically.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你已经有一个「桌面应用」类型的客户端（例如按 Google 官方 Gemini API OAuth 文档创建的），把 ID 和密钥都填上即可，会自动走本地回环回调的流程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你已經有一個「桌面應用」型別的客戶端（例如按 Google 官方 Gemini API OAuth 文件建立的），把 ID 和金鑰都填上即可，會自動走本地迴環回撥的流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Note: whether a self-created client gets the same free quota as the Gemini CLI depends on Google's own client checks and is not guaranteed. Fall back to an API key if sign-in fails.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注意：用自建客户端能否拿到 Gemini CLI 那套免费额度，取决于 Google 侧对客户端身份的校验，不保证可用。失败时请继续使用 API Key。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "注意：用自建客戶端能否拿到 Gemini CLI 那套免費額度，取決於 Google 側對客戶端身份的校驗，不保證可用。失敗時請繼續使用 API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go back one screen and \"OAuth\" will be listed among Gemini's authentication methods.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回上一页后，Gemini 的认证方式里会出现「OAuth」选项。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回上一頁後，Gemini 的認證方式裡會出現「OAuth」選項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
