    "Generate once, then on the computer run:  echo '<public key>' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys — after that no password is needed. If the address starts with 100.x (Tailscale), the Tailscale app on this device must be connected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成一次即可，然后在电脑上执行：echo '<公钥>' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys ——之后无需密码。如果地址是 100.x 开头（Tailscale），本设备上的 Tailscale 必须处于连接状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成一次即可，然後在電腦上執行：echo '<公鑰>' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys ——之後無需密碼。如果地址是 100.x 開頭（Tailscale），本裝置上的 Tailscale 必須處於連線狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud keeps rejecting requests (error 15) — sync paused until next launch to keep the app responsive. Local changes are safe and will upload once iCloud recovers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 持续拒绝请求（错误 15）——为保持 App 流畅，同步已暂停到下次启动。本地更改是安全的，iCloud 恢复后会自动补传。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 持續拒絕請求（錯誤 15）——為保持 App 流暢，同步已暫停到下次啟動。本地更改是安全的，iCloud 恢復後會自動補傳。"
          }
        }
      }
