    "Location rules wake the agent when you arrive or leave (may take a few minutes — iOS decides). Event and charging rules fire when the app reconciles. Three thumbs-down auto-pauses a rule. Time-of-day rules live in Scheduled Tasks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置规则在你到达或离开时唤醒 Agent(可能有几分钟延迟,由 iOS 决定)。日程与充电规则在 App 对账时触发。连续三次 👎 会自动暂停规则。按时间触发的规则在「定时任务」里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置規則在你到達或離開時喚醒 Agent(可能有幾分鐘延遲,由 iOS 決定)。日程與充電規則在 App 對賬時觸發。連續三次 👎 會自動暫停規則。按時間觸發的規則在「定時任務」裡。"
          }
        }
      }
