    "No gateway yet. Add the Mac that runs your Hermes agent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有网关。添加运行 Hermes Agent 的那台 Mac。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有閘道器。新增執行 Hermes 代理的那臺 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gateway is a Hermes agent running on your own Mac. It keeps working while your phone is asleep, and this app can watch, approve and stop its work from anywhere on your tailnet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网关是跑在你自己 Mac 上的 Hermes Agent。手机休眠时它照常干活,而这个 App 可以在 tailnet 的任何地方观察、审批、停止它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閘道器是跑在你自己 Mac 上的 Hermes 代理。手機休眠時它照常幹活,而這個 App 可以在 tailnet 的任何地方觀察、審批、停止它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the machine's tailnet hostname, not its IP — the certificate is selected by hostname and an IP address will fail to connect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请填这台机器的 tailnet 主机名,不要填 IP——证书是按主机名选择的,用 IP 会连不上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請填這臺機器的 tailnet 主機名,不要填 IP——證書是按主機名選擇的,用 IP 會連不上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
