    "iCloud rejected the request (code 15). Automatic recovery is skipped for large pending queues — use Force Full Sync in Sync Settings if this persists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud rejected the request (code 15). Automatic recovery is skipped for large pending queues — use Force Full Sync in Sync Settings if this persists."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 拒绝了请求（代码 15）。待上传的内容太多时不会自动恢复；一直这样的话，到同步设置里点「强制完整同步」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 拒絕了請求（代碼 15）。待上傳的內容太多時不會自動恢復；一直這樣的話，到同步設定裡點「強制完整同步」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google rejected the OAuth client (invalid_client). Add your own Google Cloud OAuth client under Add Provider → Google sign-in setup. An \"iOS\" application type (bundle ID com.leoyuan.leophoneagent, no secret) is recommended; a \"Desktop app\" client with its secret also works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google rejected the OAuth client (invalid_client). Add your own Google Cloud OAuth client under Add Provider → Google sign-in setup. An \"iOS\" application type (bundle ID com.leoyuan.leophoneagent, no secret) is recommended; a \"Desktop app\" client with its secret also works."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google 拒绝了这个 OAuth 客户端（invalid_client）。到「添加 AI 服务商 → Google 登录设置」里填上你自己的 Google Cloud OAuth 客户端：推荐「iOS」类型（包 ID com.leoyuan.leophoneagent，不需要密钥）；带密钥的「桌面应用」客户端也可以。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google 拒絕了這個 OAuth 用戶端（invalid_client）。到「新增 AI 服務商 → Google 登入設定」裡填上你自己的 Google Cloud OAuth 用戶端：建議「iOS」類型（套件 ID com.leoyuan.leophoneagent，不需要密鑰）；帶密鑰的「桌面應用程式」用戶端也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
