    "✅ /root restored. The backup is kept until you delete it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✅ /root 已恢复。备份会一直保留，直到你删除它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "✅ /root 已恢復。備份會一直保留，直到你刪除它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Reset: Delete everything\n• Backup: Save /root directory, kept on this device until you delete it\n• Restore: Put the latest /root backup back (installs the rootfs first if needed)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 重置：删除全部内容\n• 备份：保存 /root 目录，一直留在这台设备上，直到你删除\n• 恢复：放回最近一次 /root 备份（需要时会先安装 rootfs）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will backup your /root directory, then reset the rootfs. The backup stays on this device; after the app restarts, come back here and tap Restore User Data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
