          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API keys (including the key an OpenRouter sign-in creates) and pasted tokens are stored in the iOS Keychain and can sync through iCloud Keychain; ChatGPT, xAI and Kimi sign-ins stay on this device only. Provider configuration may also sync through your iCloud account when iCloud Sync is enabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key（包括 OpenRouter 登录时生成的 Key）和手动粘贴的 Token 保存在 iOS 钥匙串，可随 iCloud 钥匙串同步；ChatGPT、xAI 和 Kimi 的登录凭证只保留在本机。开启 iCloud 同步后，供应商配置也可能通过你的 iCloud 账户同步"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key（包括 OpenRouter 登入時產生的 Key）和手動貼上的 Token 保存在 iOS 鑰匙圈，可隨 iCloud 鑰匙圈同步；ChatGPT、xAI 和 Kimi 的登入憑證只保留在本機。開啟 iCloud 同步後，供應商設定也可能透過你的 iCloud 帳號同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signing in creates an OpenRouter API key. It is stored in the iOS Keychain, can sync through iCloud Keychain, and is only sent to OpenRouter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录会生成一个 OpenRouter API Key。它保存在 iOS 钥匙串，可随 iCloud 钥匙串同步，且只会发送给 OpenRouter。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入會產生一個 OpenRouter API Key。它保存在 iOS 鑰匙圈，可隨 iCloud 鑰匙圈同步，且只會傳送給 OpenRouter。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
