    "选择已配对并授权同步的常在线 Mac。首次启用会发送已允许同步的数据；iCloud 开关独立生效。关闭后保留待传数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a paired, authorized Mac that stays online. Enabling this sends data allowed by your sync preferences. iCloud is controlled separately. Turning this off keeps pending data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择已配对并授权同步的常在线 Mac。首次启用会发送已允许同步的数据；iCloud 开关独立生效。关闭后保留待传数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇已配對並授權同步的常在線 Mac。首次啟用會傳送已允許同步的資料；iCloud 開關獨立生效。關閉後保留待傳資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选择此设备上传到已启用目的地的数据。环境变量和服务商密钥沿用现有编码策略；关闭对应类别可将它们保留在本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose what this device uploads to enabled destinations. Environment variables and provider keys retain the existing encoding policy; disable those categories to keep them on this device."
