    "只记录:写进诊断日志,不执行。准备:执行,结果放进会话列表,不打扰。跑完通知:执行,完成后推送通知。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Log Only: written to the diagnostics log, not run. Prepare: runs and puts the result in the chat list without interrupting. Run and Notify: runs and sends a notification when done."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只记录:写进诊断日志,不执行。准备:执行,结果放进会话列表,不打扰。跑完通知:执行,完成后推送通知。"
          }
