    "When the current model cannot read images, image-capable models in this group read them on its behalf (up to 3 tried, 90 s each) and pass a description back. This device only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the current model cannot read images, image-capable models in this group read them on its behalf (up to 3 tried, 90 s each) and pass a description back. This device only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前模型看不了图时，由这个组里能读图的模型代为读图（最多试 3 个，每个 90 秒），把描述交回当前模型。仅本机生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前模型看不了圖時，由這個組裡能讀圖的模型代為讀圖（最多試 3 個，每個 90 秒），把描述交回目前模型。僅本機生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
