          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回覆後建議追問"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只用本机模型,不联网。点建议只会填进输入框,不会自动发送;本机模型不可用、后台任务和子代理会话里不显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device model only, never online. Tapping a suggestion only fills the composer and never sends it. Hidden when the on-device model is unavailable, and in background-task and sub-agent sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只用本机模型,不联网。点建议只会填进输入框,不会自动发送;本机模型不可用、后台任务和子代理会话里不显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
