          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型多久没有任何输出就判定为卡住并自动重试,同时作为这个服务商的请求超时。留空用默认(120 秒),可填 30–600。只保存在这台设备上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long the model may produce no output before it's treated as stuck and retried; also used as this provider's request timeout. Leave empty for the default (120 s); 30–600 allowed. Saved on this device only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型多久没有任何输出就判定为卡住并自动重试,同时作为这个服务商的请求超时。留空用默认(120 秒),可填 30–600。只保存在这台设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型多久沒有任何輸出就判定為卡住並自動重試,同時作為這個服務商的請求逾時。留空用預設(120 秒),可填 30–600。只儲存在這台裝置上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Client ID 留空时,会从服务器自动发现授权端点并注册客户端;找不到再手动填写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave Client ID empty to discover the authorization endpoints from the server and register a client automatically; fill it in manually if that fails."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Client ID 留空时,会从服务器自动发现授权端点并注册客户端;找不到再手动填写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Client ID 留空時,會從伺服器自動發現授權端點並註冊用戶端;找不到再手動填寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动发现授权信息需要 https 的服务器地址;也可以手动填写 Client ID 和端点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic discovery needs an https server URL. You can also enter the Client ID and endpoints manually."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动发现授权信息需要 https 的服务器地址;也可以手动填写 Client ID 和端点。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動發現授權資訊需要 https 的伺服器位址;也可以手動填寫 Client ID 和端點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有从服务器找到授权信息,请手动填写 Client ID 和端点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server didn't publish authorization details. Enter the Client ID and endpoints manually."
