    "图片太大：一次发送的图片合计要在 1.8 MB 以内，压缩到最小仍超出。请少选几张再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Images too large: all images in one message must total under 1.8 MB, and they are still over at the smallest size. Choose fewer images and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图片太大：一次发送的图片合计要在 1.8 MB 以内，压缩到最小仍超出。请少选几张再试。"
